      "statusChangeID": "6b072876bf667ed79fc417ec",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "We've identified the issue as a routing issue from the USW servers to a specific ISP (Comcast), we're working with our upstream providers to resolve this.\n\nWhile things are being resolved a temporary solution is to use tools which alter the route your traffic takes such as Cloudflare WARP or a VPN.\n\nAnd thank you for the individual comments on this post with further details of personal experiences with the issue, issues like these can be hard get to the bottom of and the more details provided the easier it is to narrow down what specifically is going wrong.\n\nIf you are experiencing this issue and are not connected via Comcast (directly or indirectly) or are not connected to the USW region please do provide more details as it may be a separate issue. If those details contain anything personally identifiable feel free to contact via the help desk (https://help.vrchat.com) instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
